- Resolve: Yasuo generates a stack of Flow for every 59 / 52.5 / 46 (based on level) units he travels by any means. At[ 100 stacks ][ 5900 / 5250 / 4600 (based on level) units traveled ]and upon taking damage from an enemy champion or monster, Yasuo consumes all Flow to grant himself a shield for 125 : 600 (based on level) that lasts for 1 second."]}]},{"slot":"Q","variants":[{"name":"Steel Tempest","rows":[{"attribute":"Physical Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[20,45,70,95,120],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[105,105,105,105,105],"units":["% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD"]}]}],"damageType":"PHYSICAL_DAMAGE","effects":["Steel Wind Rising: If this hits at least one enemy, Yasuo generates a stack of Gathering Storm for 6 seconds, stacking up to 2 times and refreshing on subsequent hits. At 2 stacks, the next Steel Tempest cast consumes them all to become empowered with a new effect.","Gathering Storm Bonus: Yasuo unleashes a whirlwind in the target direction that deals the same damage to enemies hit and knocks them up for 0.75 seconds, or 0.9 seconds in combination with Sweeping Blade.","Steel Tempest's thrust will fail to hit targets after the cast time if Yasuo was affected by disarming crowd control during it, but the cooldown of the ability is reset to 0.1 seconds.","If Steel Tempest is cast during Sweeping Blade, it will instead affect enemies around Yasuo at the end of the dash, or doing so immediately at his landing location after blinking while ending the dash prematurely. Steel Tempest's cast time is not incurred in this case."]}]},{"slot":"W","variants":[{"name":"Wind Wall","rows":[{"attribute":"Wall Width","modifiers":[{"values":[320,390,460,530,600],"units":["","","","",""]}]}],"damageType":null,"effects":[]}]},{"slot":"E","variants":[{"name":"Sweeping Blade","rows":[{"attribute":"Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[70,85,100,115,130],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[20,20,20,20,20],"units":["% bonus AD","% bonus AD","% bonus AD","% bonus AD","%